OL,3,GNEWSATaking a survey in school saved me
OL,4,Afrom homelessness
OL,5,
OL,6,FSomething as innocuous as filling in a
OL,7,Fsurvey at school "changed the course"
OL,8,Fof Emily Mapley's life after her family
OL,9,Fwas made homeless when she was 13.
OL,11,FAlready being bullied and questioning
OL,12,Fher identity, she hid the fact she was
OL,13,Fsharing two rooms with six other family
OL,14,Fmembers for almost two years.
OL,16,FThen, a UK-first survey by Upstream
OL,17,FCymru led to the support she needed.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
