OL,3,GNEWSATaking a survey in school saved me
OL,4,Afrom homelessness
OL,5,
OL,6,FBased on a project in Australia that
OL,7,Fled to a 40% reduction in youth
OL,8,Fhomelessness, the survey reached young
OL,9,Fpeople who may not have come across the
OL,10,Fradar of support services before.
